+refuse” remains intentionally untouched: it is true for the local-owner
+path, while remote-owner relative staleness is the separate structural
+case documented in the task result. The `observeRemoteWinner` redundancy
+and grant-less remote-owner product question remain recorded-only
+dispositions, not simplifications or decisions here.
