+- TRACEABILITY: candidate registry digest re-derived as `ed6f016f73e390071743b09aded229e781d95408b0b9eeb3f134fcb87bb9a893`; exact-tree tracecheck prints `contracts=64 normative_sections=36 acceptance_cases=154 fixtures=33 compatibility_contracts=55 assigned_scopes=0` and `section coverage: bindings=69 full=4 partial=9 sliver=9 unevidenced=43 unmeasured=4 unowned=7 clauses_discharged=70/574`. Section 2.4 admits; section 5.3 correctly refuses assigned-scope admission at 7/8 partial coverage.
+- P3 DISPOSITIONS: the axpane `decide.go` “lapsed grants refuse” qualifier remains untouched and is scoped to the local-owner path; `observeRemoteWinner` structural redundancy is record-only; the grant-less remote interactive-owner step-4 product question remains unresolved and undecided; evidence records the candidate tree OID before this logbook append (`276c515c90665327b991fe1cdf78ef8086cd409c`) and keeps the exact test masks beside every row count.
+- VALIDATION: all 30 commands from `spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands` exited 0, including full test, race, coverage, fuzz, tracecheck, catalog check, Linux/Windows builds, JSON parse, board validation, and diff check. Explicit `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...` also exited 0. `task-board validate` printed pre-existing `MISSING_ACTIVITY` diagnostics but exited 0. Logs are under `.temp/BUG-260917-3lddu0/validation/`.
